{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf1HkZhT73JZz5RGYtJzR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All 17 tests pass including the 4 new confirm endpoint tests. Let me create a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\nI successfully implemented the `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint for the BE-003 task. Here's what was done:\n\n### Changes Made\n\n**1. ApiError.kt** - Added error code for invalid shipment status:\n- Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` enum value to ErrorCode\n\n**2. ShipmentController.kt** - Implemented the confirm endpoint:\n- `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` endpoint\n- Throws `ResourceNotFoundException` (404) if shipment not found\n- Throws `ConflictException` (409) with `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` if shipment is CANCELLED\n- Returns shipment unchanged if already CONFIRMED (idempotent/retry-safe)\n- Saves and returns shipment with status changed to CONFIRMED if it's CREATED\n\n**3. ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added comprehensive tests:\n- ✅ Confirming a CREATED shipment moves it to CONFIRMED\n- ✅ Confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds (idempotent)\n- ✅ Confirming a CANCELLED shipment returns 409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS\n- ✅ Confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Met\n- ✅ Existing build passes (BUILD SUCCESS)\n- ✅ Existing tests pass (17/17 tests pass)\n- ✅ New endpoint confirms created shipments and persists changes\n- ✅ Error responses consistent with API envelope\n- ✅ Retry-safe (CONFIRMED idempotent, CANCELLED rejected, unknown rejected)\n- ✅ No new Maven dependencies\n- ✅ Only shipment feature files modified"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":320,"cache_read_input_tokens":98085,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":320},"outpu